{"version":1,"content":"<p>投資者正加速從美國上市的比特幣ETF撤資，使持續承壓的比特幣失去一大關鍵支撐。數據顯示，上周12隻ETF資金淨流出約18億美元，創6月以來最大單周流出規模，並連續第四周遭遇資金淨流出。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587620.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T09:23:53.234740+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:58:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166516+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:13.166516+00:00","content_hash":"8ecc584b64d898c955189ad92970a82b1476d3a325f915ca9e0c76a0d8e7801d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}